+// SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-3-Clause
+/*
+ * Samsung Galaxy Book4 Edge 15.6" (NP750XQA), Snapdragon X Plus X1P42100.
+ *
+ * Derived from the X1E80100 Galaxy Book4 Edge DTS. Board wiring follows this
+ * machine's own DSDT: keyboard i2c0/0x05/GPIO67, touchpad i2c13/0x40/GPIO3,
+ * EC event GPIO66, lid GPIO92, HDMI HPD GPIO126, WLAN enable GPIO117 + PCIe4
+ * PERST GPIO146, BT enable GPIO116, two Samsung Type-C controllers and UFS.
+ *
+ * Panel power and backlight rails use the X1P reference wiring (edp regulator
+ * on GPIO70, backlight rail pmc8380_3 gpio10, enable gpio4, PMK8550 PWM), taken
+ * from x1p42100-lenovo-thinkbook-16.dts and verified on this board.
+ *
+ * Camera: ov02c10 on CCI0/0x36 behind CSIPHY0 (values from the Qualcomm AeoB
+ * firmware profile of this machine). Audio: two WSA883x speakers on the WSA
+ * bus, WCD9385 headset codec, four DMICs at 2.4 MHz.
